		},
		{
			"Author": "Nikola Hristov",
			"Date": "2026-04-16T12:16:23Z",
			"File": [
				"⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀",
				1024,
				2
			],
			"Message": "refactor(Wind): Improve extension host debugging observability\n\nEnhance the extension host handshake and RPC message handling in Preload with more granular performance marks and debug logging.\n\nChanges:\n- Split single `handshake-complete` mark into three specific marks: `init-data-received`, `initialized-sent`, and `ready-sent`\n- Add debug logging that outputs init data byte size and text preview (first 200 chars) for diagnosing initialization issues\n- Rename message performance marks from `message:N` to `rpc:N` for clarity\n- Log the first 5 RPC messages with byte size and preview for debugging protocol issues\n\nThese improvements enable better visibility into the extension host initialization flow and help diagnose communication problems between Wind and Cocoon.",
			"SHA": "ac7901cbfc16e1aceb5e5aad67c36ab710d3dee6"
		},
